# Docker build context ignore for the bridge image asset.
#
# The bridge image's `ContainerImage.fromAsset` build context is the MONOREPO
# ROOT (the Dockerfile COPYs package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, pnpm-workspace.yaml,
# tsconfig.base.json and the whole packages/core + packages/bridge trees). Docker
# reads the `.dockerignore` from the CONTEXT root, so it must live HERE -- the
# packages/bridge/.dockerignore is never consulted for this context.
#
# cdk.out is the critical entry: the repo root contains packages/cdk/cdk.out, and
# staging it into the asset recurses (ENAMETOOLONG). node_modules is re-installed
# by the Dockerfile's own pnpm `deps` stage, so the host copy is pure waste.

**/node_modules
**/cdk.out
**/.api-bundle
.git
**/.git

# Build output / detritus not needed by the image build.
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
*.log
.agents
.mise-data
.mise-cache
.extralib
